  <dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00266961_CashAndCashEquivalentsOfFinancialAssetsTypeMemberOfRestrictedFinancialInstrumentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">임대보증금 관련 35,616백만원에 대해 질권을 설정하였습니다.</dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets>
  <dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00266961_RestrictedShortTermAndLongTermFinancialInstrumentsOfFinancialAssetsTypeMemberOfRestrictedFinancialInstrumentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">장단기금융상품 중 동반성장 협력을 위해 13,760백만원을 예치하였습니다.</dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets>
  <dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00266961_RestrictedTimeDepositOfFinancialAssetsTypeMemberOfRestrictedFinancialInstrumentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기말 현재 회사는 종업원 금융기관 대출과 관련하여 정기예금 77,200백만원이 담보로 제공되어 있습니다.</dart:ExplanationOfRestrictedFinancialAssets>
  <dart:RestrictedFinancialAssets contextRef="CFY2025eHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_entity00266961_CashAndCashEquivalentsOfFinancialAssetsTypeMemberOfRestrictedFinancialInstrumentsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">35616000000</dart:RestrictedFinancialAssets>
