  <entity00266961:SubjectOfGuaranteeOfDisclosureOfPaymentGuaranteeOfSubsidiariesOfDisclosureOfPaymentGuaranteeOfSubsidiaries2TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember" xml:lang="ko">지급보증계약 대상이 되는 차입금은 Mizuho Bank 차입금 5년물 JPY 350억, SMBC차입금 5년물 JPY 350억, MUFG 차입금 4년물 JPY 221.6억 입니다.</entity00266961:SubjectOfGuaranteeOfDisclosureOfPaymentGuaranteeOfSubsidiariesOfDisclosureOfPaymentGuaranteeOfSubsidiaries2TableOfItems>
